---
/* ============================================================
   roots.astro   (a PAGE — lives in src/pages/portfolio/)

   This is the Roots Film Festival project page. It feeds
   content into the reusable ProjectPage layout.

   URL: /portfolio/roots  (matches the card link in your listing)

   To make the OTHER four project pages later, copy this file,
   rename it (e.g. irdeto.astro), and swap the content. The
   layout stays identical.

   IMAGES: put the files in public/portfolio/roots/ and the
   paths below will work. Names are placeholders — rename to
   match your real files (or rename your files to match these).
   ============================================================ */

import ProjectPage from '../../layouts/ProjectPage.astro';

// Building blocks for the part below the description
import FeatureImage from '../../components/project/FeatureImage.astro';
import BigSmall from '../../components/project/BigSmall.astro';
import Statement from '../../components/project/Statement.astro';
import UnevenPair from '../../components/project/UnevenPair.astro';
import MyPart from '../../components/project/MyPart.astro';
---

<ProjectPage
  pageTitle="Roots Film Festival — Paulina Cywoniuk"
  pageDescription="Visual identity for the ROOTS Film Festival at Filmhuis Den Haag."

  logo="/portfolio/roots/roots-logo.png"
  logoAlt="ROOTS Film Festival logo"

  title="Roots Film Festival"
  subtitle="Designing Visual Identity for a Local Film Festival"

  headerImage="/portfolio/roots/roots-header.jpg"
  headerAlt="ROOTS Film Festival banner on a building facade"

  accent="var(--color-orange)"
  accentText="var(--color-purple)"

  keywords={["Graphic Design", "Visual Identity", "Team", "3 months"]}
>

  <!-- DESCRIPTION (default slot). Your real text, in paragraphs. -->
  <p>
    "ROOTS" is a film festival in The Hague organised by the Filmhuis.
    This film event provides a platform for filmmakers from The Hague and
    fosters connections among local filmmakers, contributing to a vibrant
    and positive film culture in the city.
  </p>
  <p>
    Together with a team of other students, I was commissioned to design a
    visual identity for it. The commission included the logo, posters and
    banners, flags, tote bags, coasters, Instagram marketing posts, big-screen
    images and everything the festival needed. Personally, I worked on the
    digital deliverables, such as the website and mail header.
  </p>
  <p>
    As a team, we collaborated closely to develop the entire graphic identity
    from the ground up, ensuring the festival's look and feel were both
    engaging and consistent across all media. The goal was not only to capture
    the essence of the festival but also to create a visual experience that
    would resonate with the local film community.
  </p>

  <!-- SECTIONS (named slot): the building blocks below the
       description, top to bottom. Reorder, remove or repeat them. -->
  <Fragment slot="sections">

    <FeatureImage
      src="/portfolio/roots/roots-1.png"
      alt="Three ROOTS posters on a concrete wall with a passer-by"
      
      caption="Posters design"
      ratio="16 / 9"
    />

       <BigSmall
      bigSrc="/portfolio/roots/roots-2.png"
      bigAlt="ROOTS banner and yellow flag on the Filmhuis building"
       smallSrc="/portfolio/roots/roots-5.jpg"
      smallAlt="NEW: image coming soon"
      heading="One line, on everything."
    >
      Banners, flags, posters, coasters, totes, Instagram and the big screen.
    </BigSmall>

    <Statement>
      Logo inspired by the unrolling film tape. Modular design system for all festival deliverables - veritcal and horizontal.
    </Statement>

        <UnevenPair
      aSrc="/portfolio/roots/roots-4.png"
      aAlt="ROOTS coasters in six colours next to a wine glass"
      aCaption="Coasters"
      bSrc="/portfolio/roots/roots-3.jpg"
      bAlt="Pile of ROOTS tote bags"
      bCaption="Tote bags for festival guests"
    />

        <MyPart
      heading="My part: the digital side"
      mainSrc="/portfolio/roots/roots-website-mockup.jpg"
      mainAlt="NEW: website mockup in a laptop frame"
      strips={[
        { src: '/portfolio/roots/roots-email-banner1.jpg', alt: 'ROOTS email banner with a film still and the Filmhuis Den Haag logo' },
        { src: '/portfolio/roots/roots-email-banner2.jpg', alt: 'ROOTS email banner with a film still and the Filmhuis Den Haag logo' },
        
      ]}
    >
      I designed the festival's website page and mail header. Webiste of the Filmhuis Den Haag has it's own style of using black and white headers, so my design needed to reflect their visual identity while also incorporating the ROOTS branding. The email banners were designed to be visually engaging.
    </MyPart>

  </Fragment>

</ProjectPage>